From 13b335243c50cd602711aabddf3eddf845056c23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kiran Murugulla <kmurugulla@adobe.com>
Date: Sun, 17 May 2026 14:41:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: complete site migration from spvbstemple.org

- Add 16 custom block variants (carousel-hero, cards-donation, cards-service,
  cards-event, cards-teaching, cards-event-detail, cards-project, cards-seva,
  cards-video, columns-contact, columns-donate, columns-video, embed-video,
  hero-about, table-donor, accordion-faq)
- Migrate design system: Cinzel Decorative headings, Inter body, Noto Sans
  Devanagari nav fonts with temple color palette (red, gold, cream, dark)
- Update header/footer CSS for temple branding (fixed nav, dark footer)
- Add brand.css with CSS custom properties for design tokens
- Add Google Fonts loading in head.html
- Add import infrastructure (16 parsers, 2 transformers, 9 import scripts)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
